<title>USA: Trans Financial names chief executive.</title>
<headline>Trans Financial names chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>BOWLING GREEN, Kentucky 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Trans Financial on Monday said its board of directors appointed Vince Berta as president and chief executive officer of the financial services company.  </p>
<p>It said Berta assumes the post after serving as acting president and chief executive since June 4.</p>
<p>Berta, 38, joined Trans Financial in 1993 as senior vice president and chief financial officer, after serving as vice president for PNC Financial Corp in Pittsburgh.</p>
<p>It did not say who he was replacing.</p>
